<title>NEW ZEALAND: AMP says has 8.09 pct in NZ's Warehouse.</title>
<headline>AMP says has 8.09 pct in NZ's Warehouse.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian financial giant Australian Mutual Provident Society (AMP) on Monday declared that its total interest in New Zealand retailer The Warehouse Group Limited was 8.09 percent.</p>
<p>In a statement to the New Zealand Stock Exchange, whose rules require disclosure when a company's stake in another exceeds 5.0 percent, AMP said it had become a substantial shareholder on April 2 this year.</p>
<p>--Wellington newsroom +64-4 4734 746</p>
</text>
